        "Target Matching",
        "Ensure Targeting Minimums"
      ],
      "Text": "Use the organizationalEntityFollowerStatistics API to check if a particular segment meets the 300 follower minimum before attempting to POST an organization share. This API returns follower counts segmented across all relevant facets.",
